<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 2.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 2.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    94/95    100/105     UNQ     201/204</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   97/98    103/104   195/200   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices held recent levels on Wednesday after earlier firmer quotes were calmed by a steady tone in the fuel oil market. Some shippers were unwilling to buy just yet, believing prices were being held artificially high amid high storage levels.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
